{{!
    @template local_catquiz/feedback/feedbackform_collapsible

    The collapsible of a scale in the feedback part of the test settings form.

    Issue #32: one template instead of an opening and a closing fragment in two files, which the
    template lint could only see as broken HTML. The form puts its own elements between the opening
    and the closing part and nests the collapsibles by depth, so it renders the template twice: once
    with "open", once with "close". Rendered with both, the template is complete - the example below
    is checked that way - and another template that includes it as a parent with open and close can
    fill the body through the block "body".

    Classes required for JS:
    * none
    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-toggle, data-target (Bootstrap 4 collapse; Moodle 4.5) and their data-bs-* twins, data-name,
      data-depth (quizsettingsexpandcollapsible)
    Context variables required for this template:
    * open - emit the opening part
    * close - emit the closing part
    * headerid, collapseid, accordionid - ids of the header, the collapse and the accordion
    * headername - the title of the collapsible
    * dataname, datadepth - name and depth of the scale for the scripts

    Example context (json):
    {
      "open": true,
      "close": true,
      "headerid": "catquiz_feedback_header_2",
      "collapseid": "catquiz_feedback_collapse_2",
      "accordionid": "accordion_header_scaleid_2",
      "datadepth": "0",
      "dataname": "Mathematik",
      "headername": "Mathematik"
    }
}}
{{#open}}
<div id="{{accordionid}}">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header" id="{{headerid}}">
            <h5 class="mb-0">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-link"
                    data-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-target="#{{collapseid}}"
                    data-bs-target="#{{collapseid}}"
                    aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-controls="{{collapseid}}">
                    {{headername}}
                </button>
            </h5>
        </div>
        <div id="{{collapseid}}"
            class="collapse"
            role="region"
            aria-labelledby="{{headerid}}"
            data-parent="#{{accordionid}}"
            data-bs-parent="#{{accordionid}}"
            data-name="{{dataname}}"
            data-depth="{{datadepth}}">
            <div class="card-body">
{{/open}}
{{$body}}{{/body}}
{{#close}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{{/close}}
